[DANNY]
Joseph Conrad once wrote that "murder is always with us. It's almost an institution." That couldn't rang more true than with me.
ໂຈເຊຟ ຄອນຣາດເຄີຍຂຽນວ່າ"ການຄາດຕະກໍາຢູ່ກັບພວກເຮົາຢູ່ສະເຫມີ
